  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In development studies, what does UNDP report typically focus on?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Environmental sustainability issues"},{"id":"b","text":"Human Development Index components"},{"id":"c","text":"Economic productivity measurements"},{"id":"d","text":"Income inequality analysis"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which term is used to measure the proportion of children surviving to a certain age?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Per Capita Income"},{"id":"b","text":"Literacy Rate"},{"id":"c","text":"Human Development Index"},{"id":"d","text":"Infant Mortality Rate"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does 'without me they cannot develop' imply in a development context?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Individuals should not be part of the society's progress"},{"id":"b","text":"Development is dependent on individual contribution"},{"id":"c","text":"Society can function without any individuals"},{"id":"d","text":"Progress happens independently of human effort"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does the National Family Health Survey contribute to development discussions?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"By providing data on economic growth"},{"id":"b","text":"By offering insights into health and education indicators"},{"id":"c","text":"By measuring environmental impact only"},{"id":"d","text":"By evaluating purchasing power parity"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which indicator is NOT typically used to measure quality of life?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Per Capita Income"},{"id":"b","text":"Human Development Index (HDI)"},{"id":"c","text":"Life Expectancy at Birth"},{"id":"d","text":"Attendance Ratio in schools"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does the Gross National Income Per Capita reflect?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Total national income per person"},{"id":"b","text":"Country's population growth rate"},{"id":"c","text":"Growth of exports over imports ratio"},{"id":"d","text":"Average monthly salary in a country"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which development indicator measures the ability to access education?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Per Capita Income"},{"id":"b","text":"Literacy Rate"},{"id":"c","text":"Human Development Index"},{"id":"d","text":"Attendance Ratio"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is a potential limitation of using Purchasing Power Parity for development analysis?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It does not account for income inequality"},{"id":"b","text":"It overestimates the country's economic size"},{"id":"c","text":"It underestimates rural poverty levels"},{"id":"d","text":"It focuses too much on industrial sectors"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is a common misconception about development?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Development cannot be achieved without global cooperation"},{"id":"b","text":"Individuals can achieve development independently of their country's policies"},{"id":"c","text":"Development only benefits the wealthy"},{"id":"d","text":"Sustainability goals are unrelated to economic indicators"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why might understanding history and political science be important for learning about development?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Because they offer historical context and democratic processes insights"},{"id":"b","text":"Because they provide direct financial data on GDP growth"},{"id":"c","text":"Because they are the only sources of economic indicators"},{"id":"d","text":"Because they focus solely on environmental sustainability issues"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does a high Human Development Index (HDI) indicate?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Low income levels in society"},{"id":"b","text":"High literacy and education rates"},{"id":"c","text":"High infant mortality rates"},{"id":"d","text":"Limited access to health services"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which statement best describes the relationship between development indicators and actual human well-being?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Indicators are purely theoretical and do not reflect real conditions"},{"id":"b","text":"Indicators directly measure human happiness and satisfaction"},{"id":"c","text":"Indicators are general measures that can vary widely in quality and accuracy"},{"id":"d","text":"Indicators always align with the goals of sustainable development"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does a country's economic performance affect its ranking on Human Development Index?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It has no effect; rankings are random"},{"id":"b","text":"Better performance leads to higher rankings"},{"id":"c","text":"Higher GDP correlates with lower HDI scores"},{"id":"d","text":"Performance is inversely related to HDI scores"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What role does political stability play in achieving development?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It has no impact on economic indicators"},{"id":"b","text":"It enhances the effectiveness of development policies and programs"},{"id":"c","text":"It solely affects foreign investment flows"},{"id":"d","text":"It increases corruption within government institutions"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why is it important to consider environmental factors in development?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"They are only relevant for tourism industries"},{"id":"b","text":"They affect natural resources and sustainable growth"},{"id":"c","text":"They have no impact on economic activities"},{"id":"d","text":"They solely influence agricultural productivity"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is the significance of 'development' in relation to a country's political process?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It ensures equal distribution of resources only"},{"id":"b","text":"It leads to more equitable and inclusive societies"},{"id":"c","text":"It decreases public participation in governance"},{"id":"d","text":"It prioritizes economic growth over social issues"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is the primary goal of development?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"To increase a country's GDP exponentially"},{"id":"b","text":"To ensure sustainable and equitable progress for all citizens"},{"id":"c","text":"To promote technological advancements only"},{"id":"d","text":"To protect natural resources at the expense of economic growth"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How can education contribute to development?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"By increasing literacy rates alone"},{"id":"b","text":"It has no impact on economic or social progress"},{"id":"c","text":"It solely focuses on improving health outcomes"},{"id":"d","text":"It enhances skills and knowledge for better participation in society"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which of the following best explains 'development'?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Simply increasing a country's GDP"},{"id":"b","text":"Achieving higher literacy rates and life expectancy"},{"id":"c","text":"Ensuring equal access to resources regardless of social status"},{"id":"d","text":"All of the above, with emphasis on economic growth"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is implied by 'Without me they cannot develop... in a development context?'$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Society can progress without individual effort or participation"},{"id":"b","text":"Development depends solely on government actions"},{"id":"c","text":"Individual contributions are crucial for societal progress"},{"id":"d","text":"Economic factors are the sole determinants of development"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is the role of 'democratic political process' in achieving development?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It ensures that only the elite benefit from development policies"},{"id":"b","text":"It has no significant impact on achieving sustainable and equitable progress"},{"id":"c","text":"It promotes inclusive growth by involving all citizens"},{"id":"d","text":"It solely focuses on economic reforms without social considerations"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does 'development' mean to a multinational company dealing in petroleum and metals?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"To ensure safe disposal of toxic waste"},{"id":"b","text":"To maximize profit from petrochemicals and metals sales"},{"id":"c","text":"To promote tourism in the area"},{"id":"d","text":"To reduce carbon emissions globally"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is a possible consequence for the local population living near open-air dumps?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Immediate economic benefits from waste management"},{"id":"b","text":"Increased risk of health issues due to toxic exposure"},{"id":"c","text":"Enhanced property values in affected areas"},{"id":"d","text":"Decreased pollution levels in the surrounding environment"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In which scenario would a multinational company be likely to contract with local companies for waste disposal?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Where local regulations prohibit dumping toxic wastes"},{"id":"b","text":"When local companies offer cheaper labor and resources"},{"id":"c","text":"If the company aims to maintain public relations by avoiding direct involvement in waste issues"},{"id":"d","text":"All of the above scenarios are plausible"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which of these is NOT a potential outcome for the community exposed to toxic fumes from waste dumping?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Frequent health check-ups and vaccinations"},{"id":"b","text":"Increased hospitalization rates due to poisoning symptoms"},{"id":"c","text":"Community members lose their jobs due to reduced economic activity"},{"id":"d","text":"Decreased life expectancy in affected areas"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is a significant factor that might lead to different developmental goals for an area with toxic waste dumping?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The presence of multinational corporations"},{"id":"b","text":"Local government support and regulations"},{"id":"c","text":"Community involvement and mobilization"},{"id":"d","text":"Distance from the affected areas"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What could be a consequence of improper waste disposal practices in a developing country like Ivory Coast?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Increased export opportunities for waste management firms"},{"id":"b","text":"Health risks to local populations and environmental degradation"},{"id":"c","text":"Boosted economic growth due to increased employment opportunities"},{"id":"d","text":"Improved international relations with developed nations"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which of these does NOT describe a consequence of improper waste disposal in an area near an open-air dump?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Increased incidence of skin diseases like rashes and sores"},{"id":"b","text":"Higher rates of respiratory issues due to fumes inhalation"},{"id":"c","text":"Decreased fertility among affected communities over generations"},{"id":"d","text":"Health benefits from natural detoxification processes in the soil"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Who might benefit significantly from a multinational company’s decision to dispose toxic waste locally?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The local population who could be exposed to health risks"},{"id":"b","text":"Local government for compliance with regulations"},{"id":"c","text":"Companies dealing in metals and petroleum as they avoid transportation costs"},{"id":"d","text":"Environmental activists aiming to raise awareness"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How might the presence of multinational companies influence local development goals?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"By promoting sustainable waste management practices"},{"id":"b","text":"Through increased job opportunities and economic growth"},{"id":"c","text":"Encouraging dependency on foreign aid for resource management"},{"id":"d","text":"Restricting community participation in decision-making processes"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is a likely effect of local communities not being adequately informed about waste disposal practices?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Improvement in the quality of life due to reduced pollution levels"},{"id":"b","text":"Higher rates of unemployment and economic stagnation"},{"id":"c","text":"Increased public health issues from exposure to toxic fumes"},{"id":"d","text":"Enhanced community cooperation with multinational companies"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is an example of a developmental goal that could be pursued in response to the environmental damage caused by waste dumping?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Immediate cleanup and containment of toxic waste sites"},{"id":"b","text":"Promotion of eco-friendly products and services"},{"id":"c","text":"Establishment of educational programs on environmental science"},{"id":"d","text":"Increase in public transportation infrastructure"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In which scenario would the development goals be most challenged due to international laws and agreements?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"When a local government imposes stricter waste disposal regulations"},{"id":"b","text":"If multinational companies refuse to dispose of their toxic waste locally"},{"id":"c","text":"During an economic downturn causing reduced funds for development projects"},{"id":"d","text":"All of the above scenarios could challenge development goals due to legal constraints"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which factor is NOT likely to influence developmental decisions in a community affected by toxic waste dumping?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Economic interests and profit motives"},{"id":"b","text":"Societal values regarding environmental protection"},{"id":"c","text":"Educational background of local residents"},{"id":"d","text":"Local political stability and governance effectiveness"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What could be a potential consequence for the economy if multinational companies decide to dispose of their toxic waste locally?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Boost in domestic industry due to increased demand for disposal services"},{"id":"b","text":"Reduced pollution levels leading to improved health and environment"},{"id":"c","text":"Increased cost of living as prices for essential goods rise due to higher utility bills"},{"id":"d","text":"Enhanced economic growth from diversified revenue streams"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which aspect could be neglected in the development goals if multinational companies prioritize profit over community health?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Immediate cleanup and containment of toxic waste sites"},{"id":"b","text":"Promotion of eco-friendly products and services"},{"id":"c","text":"Economic growth through resource extraction"},{"id":"d","text":"Societal values regarding environmental protection, ignoring the health of local communities"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What could be a reason for multinational companies to consider disposing toxic waste locally?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"To comply with international environmental laws and regulations"},{"id":"b","text":"Local population's demand for employment opportunities in waste management"},{"id":"c","text":"Reduced transportation costs and carbon emissions from local disposal sites"},{"id":"d","text":"The presence of a large, unemployed workforce due to economic downturns elsewhere"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is an example of a developmental goal that could be pursued if multinational companies are forced by law to dispose their toxic waste locally?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Education on the importance of recycling and reducing waste production"},{"id":"b","text":"Promotion of green energy sources in affected communities"},{"id":"c","text":"Initiation of comprehensive health check-ups for local populations exposed to toxins"},{"id":"d","text":"Encouragement of community-led initiatives for environmental conservation, despite multinational companies' involvement"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What might be a consequence if a developing country fails to address the issue of toxic waste disposal?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Increased foreign investment in clean energy projects"},{"id":"b","text":"Higher rates of unemployment and economic decline due to lack of employment opportunities"},{"id":"c","text":"Enhanced reputation for environmental stewardship among international communities"},{"id":"d","text":"Decreased reliance on multinational corporations for resource management"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which developmental goal could be compromised if local governments are not involved in decision-making about waste disposal?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Promotion of sustainable waste management practices"},{"id":"b","text":"Economic growth through diversification into alternative industries"},{"id":"c","text":"Education on the importance of environmental conservation and protection"},{"id":"d","text":"Health and safety standards for local populations exposed to toxic fumes, despite multinational corporations' presence"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What could be a consequence if multinational companies prioritize profit over community health in waste disposal?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Decreased incidence of respiratory issues due to reduced pollution levels"},{"id":"b","text":"Increased public awareness and support for environmental causes"},{"id":"c","text":"Community members may feel betrayed and lose trust in corporate entities, potentially leading to social unrest or legal challenges"},{"id":"d","text":"Economic benefits for the local community from waste management activities"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which scenario best exemplifies a conflict of interest between multinational companies and local communities regarding toxic waste disposal?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Multinational companies seek to dispose of their waste legally, while local residents demand immediate cleanup"},{"id":"b","text":"Local governments provide subsidies for waste management activities to attract multinational corporations"},{"id":"c","text":"Economic incentives from foreign investors overshadow the concerns of local environmental activists and public health officials"},{"id":"d","text":"Societal values regarding environmental protection are ignored in favor of economic growth, leading to long-term detrimental effects on human health and ecosystems"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is a likely consequence if multinational companies refuse to dispose of their toxic waste locally?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Immediate improvement in the quality of life for local residents"},{"id":"b","text":"Increased economic growth due to foreign investment in clean energy projects"},{"id":"c","text":"Health risks and environmental degradation persist, potentially leading to legal action or public protest against multinational companies"},{"id":"d","text":"Enhanced reputation for corporate social responsibility among local communities"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which factor is least likely to be considered when developing a developmental goal in response to toxic waste dumping?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Economic growth and job creation opportunities"},{"id":"b","text":"Societal values regarding environmental protection and community health"},{"id":"c","text":"Educational background of the local population on environmental issues"},{"id":"d","text":"Local political stability and governance effectiveness, despite multinational companies' involvement"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In Haryana's per capita income, about what percentage increase is needed to make it similar to Kerala's?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"10%"},{"id":"b","text":"30%"},{"id":"c","text":"40%"},{"id":"d","text":"50%"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
