  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why does the Human Development Report of 2025 consider Gross National Income per capita (GNIpc) as a measure for comparing countries?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"To adjust for differences in purchasing power."},{"id":"b","text":"Because it is easier to calculate than GDP per capita."},{"id":"c","text":"It includes environmental factors in its calculations."},{"id":"d","text":"To reflect the actual income of people after taxes and transfers."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does the phrase 'We have not inherited this world from our forefathers, but we borrowed it' imply about sustainable development?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"That development is a one-time event in history that cannot be sustained."},{"id":"b","text":"That current levels of development are unsustainable and need to change."},{"id":"c","text":"Development should focus solely on economic growth without considering environmental impacts."},{"id":"d","text":"Sustainability means maintaining the status quo, as we have inherited it from previous generations."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why might BMI not be a good measure of nutrition for athletes and muscular individuals?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It overestimates body fatness in them."},{"id":"b","text":"It is less accurate in measuring muscle mass than other indicators like skinfold measurements."},{"id":"c","text":"It does not take into account their training regimens."},{"id":"d","text":"None of the above; BMI is perfectly suitable for all groups."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The Human Development Index (HDI) ranks countries based on various factors. Which factor typically has the highest weight in HDI calculations?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Income"},{"id":"b","text":"Health status"},{"id":"c","text":"Education levels"},{"id":"d","text":"Food and exercise habits"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The Human Development Report of 2025 indicates that, despite having a lower per capita income than India, Nepal has better life expectancy. What could be a plausible reason for this phenomenon?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Nepal invests more in healthcare and education."},{"id":"b","text":"India's population is larger, diluting the effect of its higher income on average health outcomes."},{"id":"c","text":"The report data might be incorrect; these factors are not related."},{"id":"d","text":"Both A and B are plausible reasons for this phenomenon."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which statement is true regarding the Human Development Index (HDI) given in the table from 2026-27?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It ranks countries based solely on per capita income."},{"id":"b","text":"Countries with higher HDI have a lower life expectancy at birth."},{"id":"c","text":"The index considers both health status and education levels for ranking."},{"id":"d","text":"An increase in HDI automatically leads to an improvement in nutrition indicators like BMI."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why is body mass index (BMI) a less reliable measure of health compared to other indicators?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Because it doesn't account for bone density or muscle mass."},{"id":"b","text":"It only considers height and weight without considering gender differences."},{"id":"c","text":"People with the same BMI can have different levels of fatness due to body composition variations."},{"id":"d","text":"All of the above are correct reasons why BMI is less reliable."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$For a country like India, which aspect of sustainable development would likely be the most challenging?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Improving its gross national income per capita (GNIpc) to match Sri Lanka's level quickly."},{"id":"b","text":"Ensuring equitable distribution of resources across states and regions."},{"id":"c","text":"Reducing dependency on foreign aid for education and healthcare."},{"id":"d","text":"Maintaining the current levels of development without any changes or improvements."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
