  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which factor is least likely to influence the availability of public health facilities?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Local community's willingness to contribute resources."},{"id":"b","text":"Government spending on healthcare infrastructure."},{"id":"c","text":"Community-led health initiatives and awareness campaigns."},{"id":"d","text":"The presence of multinational corporations in the area."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is a plausible reason for lower ration shop usage rates in West Bengal compared to Tamil Nadu?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Higher cost of living in West Bengal"},{"id":"b","text":"Less availability of government schemes in West Bengal."},{"id":"c","text":"Lower literacy levels leading to less awareness of ration shops."},{"id":"d","text":"Better public health facilities in West Bengal."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$According to the data on Table 1.5, what does a high value in column 'A' indicate about Haryana's population?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It has more people than column 'C'."},{"id":"b","text":"Column 'A' is not related to population size."},{"id":"c","text":"Column 'A' represents the total number of ration shops available."},{"id":"d","text":"Haryana likely has a larger population due to its high value in column 'A'."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
