  ('0b608a4c-059d-4550-9184-c7b1b29ca004', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In a city, many old buildings have been demolished for new construction. This development is bringing economic benefits but causing significant loss to historical sites and cultural heritage.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('69d9b0f1-87d6-4a5d-a7f8-3777c3bf1ec0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$A country is planning to develop its coastal areas for tourism. This development will likely lead to increased use of natural resources such as water, sand, and fishing grounds.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('2416e353-5c84-4ede-b05d-35e72aece378', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$A region has implemented a policy requiring all industries to invest in renewable energy sources. The main goal is to reduce pollution and dependency on non-renewable resources.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
