  ('415a09e5-9359-46de-a7ef-656b8519fb3f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$A village has been granted a grant for building a new school. However, community members are concerned about the impact on their local ecosystem and future generations.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('59fbb002-55db-4deb-b9a7-e5a7d0252ef9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$A country has initiated an initiative to increase its renewable energy capacity. This plan is expected to reduce reliance on fossil fuels and improve air quality.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('6d6a9efa-a172-4cb1-8613-de7d5cb3cfd3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$A city is planning to expand its urban limits to accommodate more residents. The plan includes constructing new housing and increasing road networks.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('d4fad015-4f26-470b-aae8-0bd356573977', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$A country has initiated a program to improve access to clean water for its rural areas. The approach includes providing subsidies for households to install rainwater harvesting systems.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('7545b2cd-edf2-4ca2-b1aa-586b429b8e8d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$A region is experiencing a decline in groundwater levels. The government has implemented regulations to reduce overuse and encourage conservation.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('ce7af70e-1d04-4706-ae4e-94ee45985f26', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$A country has implemented a program to reduce deforestation by offering incentives for reforestation. However, this program is not being well received.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('3f706334-47e9-4e25-8569-946508b9f3f6', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$A city is planning a new industrial park, which will likely cause pollution and strain existing infrastructure. The government has proposed measures to address these issues.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('7958ca80-e2a3-4733-8ce0-0e722572787a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$A region has experienced a significant drop in its HDI score. This decline is attributed to worsening health and education indicators.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('e0efd505-95c6-4f82-b3c2-d13657cc33e9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Development has many aspects and can be measured using indicators such as Per Capita Income, Literacy Rate, Infant Mortality Rate, Attendance Ratio, Life Expectancy, Gross Enrolment Ratio, and the Human Development Index (HDI). These terms are used to assess the quality of life and sustainability. However, these indicators have their limitations, such as income disparities which can skew the results.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('9ae7a6b1-ede3-469a-b63f-fdebfcbb3e4f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Development involves thinking about essential things that we require for a better life, such as equality and living together harmoniously. It also includes understanding how we can work towards achieving these goals in society.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('81e25124-c7f2-465f-9c21-6f4e9d65cc36', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The idea of development has always been with us, and we desire or aspire to live in a better way. Development also involves considering past influences on our current lives, such as history and political science.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('2e9f833d-ad9c-43a5-b722-dc6589e5d3bb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The chapter introduces us to the concept of Development, emphasizing that it is a complex task and requires understanding from various perspectives including economics, history, and political science. It further states that we need newer ways of looking at development using indicators like quality of life and environmental sustainability.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('763e7624-0716-409c-b700-7d8b9e2c34dc', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Development requires considering the broader aspects like quality of life and environmental sustainability. The chapter also mentions that these terms are used as an aid in discussion and not for memorization.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('4063aec5-47a3-4983-ab84-0c96d97dc24e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Development involves aspirations, desires, equality, living together harmoniously, inequality, and societal goals. It also acknowledges the need to understand past influences on current developments.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f39ae57f-cbf2-47e6-bd7e-bfca7119a44e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Development requires thinking about aspirations for a better life, equality among people, living together harmoniously, and societal goals. It also involves understanding historical influences and past events that shape current developments.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('6afd13c7-1549-4f82-91a9-08acdf27daa5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Development involves aspirations for a better life, equality among people, living together harmoniously, and societal goals. It also acknowledges the need for understanding past events that influence current developments.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('c939af2c-1ef7-47f6-bd08-16ae7f159c80', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Development requires thinking about the aspirations for a better life, equality among people, living together harmoniously, and societal goals. It also acknowledges the need for understanding past events that influence current developments.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('820043a0-fe0e-41d1-b0a2-5e24f3aa4a1c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Development involves thinking about aspirations for a better life, equality among people, living together harmoniously, and societal goals. It also acknowledges the need for understanding past events that influence current developments.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('8ca0ed2a-a0bb-4f59-ab2f-450310ad93d4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Development requires thinking about aspirations for a better life, equality among people, living together harmoniously, and societal goals. It also acknowledges the need for understanding past events that influence current developments.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('de53a8e6-3f73-4344-8048-d7387c63fd5e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The dumping of toxic waste has severe environmental and health impacts on both urban areas and their immediate surroundings, as witnessed in Abidjan's case where a multinational company’s negligence led to widespread poisoning incidents. The complex nature of development goals becomes evident when considering the differing perspectives: while some may view economic growth through industrial means as beneficial, others might argue that such growth at any cost could lead to severe ecological imbalances and human suffering.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('9d82ca17-cf27-44bc-9892-9c58127568b4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The table provided here shows per capita income for Haryana, Kerala, and Bihar over a year. While Haryana has the highest per capita income at Rs 3,25,759, Bihar lags behind with only around Rs 60,337. This disparity suggests that while some states have substantial financial resources, others struggle to meet basic needs. The data also includes Infant Mortality Rate (IMR) and Literacy Rate for these regions, providing a more comprehensive view of development.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('52e3fee7-1b2f-4fb0-8625-df5fb4ac0f00', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Table 1.4 reveals significant disparities in education and health outcomes across Haryana, Kerala, and Bihar. In terms of literacy rates, Kerala outperforms both states with a rate of 94%, indicating widespread access to education. Conversely, Bihar's literacy rate is significantly lower at only 62%. This disparity underscores the importance of educational investment for development.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('43e9c93b-43c3-47ac-b6cf-97211d0a53fb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Haryana has a higher infant mortality rate than Kerala, but both are significantly lower than Bihar’s rate of 27. This stark difference highlights the challenges faced by Bihar's healthcare system and underscores the critical role of maternal health interventions in reducing child deaths.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('db2a2a9a-d0b9-4063-b34c-fd1226100aa9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The table indicates that nearly one-third of children aged 15-17 years old from Bihar are not attending school at the secondary level, compared to a much higher attendance rate in Kerala. This data suggests significant disparities in educational opportunities and access between these states.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('66a1d58f-547c-4301-a320-f66deb54b635', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Haryana and Kerala both have per capita incomes above 2,00,000, but their IMRs are quite different. Haryana’s rate is much higher at 28 compared to Kerala's which is 6. This significant difference points towards varying levels of healthcare access or quality in these states.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('b4313b0d-c271-462a-916e-f33ca56dbc4e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The data shows that Bihar has a low per capita income of around 60,337 and also has one of the highest IMRs at 27. This suggests a severe lack of resources for basic healthcare and education which could be due to various socio-economic factors.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('aa2e3f8d-73c9-4dc6-81aa-166b1f69cb64', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Table 1.4 indicates that Kerala has a much higher literacy rate than Haryana, which is around 82%, compared to just 73% in Bihar and 62% in Haryana. The disparity suggests significant disparities in educational opportunities and quality.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('3de9a85c-0fdd-4312-a5b5-7bb7e85e6183', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Haryana's per capita income is significantly higher than both Kerala and Bihar. However, its IMR remains high at 28, while the IMR of Kerala and Bihar are much lower at 6 and 27 respectively. This suggests that even with a higher income, Haryana might not be achieving as good health outcomes.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('ba2730cc-d16a-4bb1-83bc-d19d2d725fb7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The table shows a significant disparity between the per capita income of Kerala and Bihar. Kerala has nearly double the income of Bihar, with its per capita income at around 281,001 compared to Bihar’s at 60,337. Despite this difference in income, both states still have low literacy rates.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('508f68a5-62d5-4033-882f-14dfea0900f9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Haryana’s per capita income is higher than Bihar's, but its IMR remains at 28 compared to Bihar’s much lower rate of 27. This suggests that while Haryana has more resources, the utilization or quality of these resources might be lacking in terms of infant mortality reduction.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f86a961d-8c02-493f-b28b-b0bbcc862d5c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Haryana’s per capita income is higher than that of Bihar at Rs 3,25,759 compared to Rs 60,337. Despite this difference, Kerala still has a significantly higher per capita income at Rs 2,81,001. This suggests that economic development alone may not be enough to improve health outcomes.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('6c2b7c4a-5c15-4b5f-8cfe-e29340e87716', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The table reveals a gap of nearly 300,000 between the per capita income of Haryana and Bihar. While Haryana's IMR is at a more manageable level of 28 compared to Bihar’s 27, it still remains relatively high. This suggests that even with higher incomes, certain health issues persist.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('8617afed-6a28-43ea-9620-1fe6eca1f53e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', 'aedc9bf9-5810-404d-af31-095336b601fc', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kerala's per capita income is significantly higher at Rs 2,81,001 compared to Bihar's at Rs 60,337. Despite this difference, Kerala still has a relatively high IMR of 6, indicating that economic development alone does not fully address health issues.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-173Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
